OL,3,AWhy are there concerns AI could
OL,4,Athreaten humanity, and how real are
OL,5,Athey?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor developers OpenAI and Anthropic
OL,8,Fhave urged lawmakers to regulate it,
OL,9,Fthough some perhaps cynically suggest
OL,10,Fthis move aims to cement their
OL,11,Fdominance over rivals.
OL,13,FRegardless, the high profile claims
OL,14,Fhave caused concern. Here's what we
OL,15,Fknow.
